          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana aamuna a Benjamini ndi awa:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 46:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bela, Bekeri, Asibeli, Gera, Naamani, Ehi, Rosi, Mupimu, Hupimu ndi Aridi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amenewa ndi zidzukulu za Yakobo mwa mkazi wake Rakele. Onse analipo khumi ndi anayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wa mwamuna wa Dani anali:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 46:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Husimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana aamuna a Nafutali ndi awa:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "GEN 46:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yahazeeli, Guni, Yezeri ndi Silemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amenewa ndi zidzukulu za Yakobo mwa Biliha amene Labani anapereka kwa mwana wake Rakele. Onse pamodzi analipo asanu ndi awiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onse amene anapita ndi Yakobo (iwo amene anali akeake, osawerengera akazi a ana ake), analipo 66.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pophatikiza ana awiri a Yosefe obadwira ku Igupto, anthu a pa banja la Yakobo amene anapita ku Igupto, onse pamodzi analipo 70.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsopano Yakobo anatumiza Yuda kwa Yosefe kukamupempha kuti akakumane naye ku Goseni. Iwo atafika ku chigawo cha Goseni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe anakonza galeta nakwerapo ndi kupita ku Goseni kukakumana ndi abambo ake, Israeli. Yosefe atangofika pamaso pa abambo ake, anawakumbatira nalira kwa nthawi yayitali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeli anati kwa Yosefe, \"Tsopano ndikhoza kumwalira poti ndaona nkhope yako kuti ukanali ndi moyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yosefe anati kwa abale ake pamodzi ndi a pa banja la abambo ake, \"Ndipita kwa Farao ndipo ndikamuwuza kuti, 'Abale anga pamodzi ndi onse a mʼnyumba ya abambo anga amene amakhala mʼdziko la Kanaani abwera kuno kwa ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anthuwa ndi abusa; amaweta ziweto zawo ndipo abwera ndi nkhosa ndi ngʼombe zawo, pamodzi ndi antchito awo.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsono Farao akakuyitanani nakufunsani kuti, 'Kodi mumagwira ntchito yanji?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyankhe kuti, 'Ife, bwana ndife oweta ziweto kuyambira ubwana wathu mpaka tsopano. Takhala tikuweta ziweto monga mmene ankachitira makolo athu.' Mukadzayankha choncho, ndiye kuti mudzakhala mʼdziko la Goseni chifukwa anthu a ku Igupto amanyansidwa nawo anthu oweta ziweto.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
